# Biome Seven (CIPlay biome_seven): the airlock, its hatch, the dome's air, the rota, three seed packets, the control
# desk, the stingrays at the outer vent, the vent shed, the gardener's locker, the sprinkler crank (dry beds hidden, full
# beds shown), the gantry box on the cap.
island Biome Seven
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Glass Dome
zone airlock
expect step 1
expect shown airlockhatch
use airlockhatch
expect hidden airlockhatch
expect story cycled 1
expect step 2
zone dome
air dome
read Gardener's rota
expect step 3
use seedtray1
use seedtray2
use seedtray3
expect story melonseed 3
expect hidden seedtray3
expect step 4
open Control desk chest
wait 3
expect step 5
zone outer_vent
kill Stingray
expect step 6
open Vent shed chest
wait 3
expect step 7
open Gardener's locker
wait 3
expect step 8
expect shown bedsdry
expect hidden bedsfull
use sprinklercrank
expect hidden bedsdry
expect shown bedsfull
expect story watered 1
expect step 9
zone b7_ridge
expect step 10
zone b7_cave
expect step 11
read Gardener's shed book
expect step 12
read Car park ticket
expect step 13
zone surface_buoy
air buoy_air
open Gantry box
wait 3
expect done
